  "id": 1082,
  "description": "Remembered\n\n&quot;What the world forgets, we become.&quot;\n\nRemembered is an ancient guild devoted to preserving the truths, histories, and relics that time seeks to erase. Neither kingdom nor crown commands their loyalty; they serve only memory itself. Its members are scholars, explorers, archivists, and guardians who recover lost knowledge, protect forgotten legacies, and ensure that heroes, civilizations, and even the darkest mistakes are never lost to oblivion. For when empires crumble and legends fade, the Remembered endure—bearing witness so that the past may never truly die.\n\n### Benefits\n* Daily Raids and Pool Buff.\n* Regular giveaways. (Membership Pack and various goodies)\n* Consumable Sponsorship \n* Helpful community.\n\n### Rules\n* Online Inactivity for 3 days period without notice will result in a kick.\n* Guild Activity (Raid/Contribution/Challenge) should be performed daily.\n* Former members may freely re-apply in the future.\n\n### RAID TIMES: \n\n* Usually around (13:00-14:00 UTC)\n\n### Communications\n* Discord - https://discord.gg/p3jzCnEswm (for raid/shooting star pings and giveaways.)\n* contact WastedPk at discord:cr4zh with any questions or inquiries.\n\nWe also have a 2nd guild Imperium of Man for low combat level character that using the same discord server and everything else.",
